# Log out and in again with the list used: ITEMORD=LOC of the settings
# file opens it again by location, the first row selected, whatever
# order and row it was left on.
T ADMIN
K ENTER
T Retro1986
K ENTER
S OPEN
K ALT-C R ALT-C R
K DOWN DOWN
S USED
K ALT-F L
S LOGOUT
T Retro1986
K ENTER
S AGAIN
K ALT-I I
K ALT-F L
S LOGOUT2
T Retro1986
K ENTER
S AGAIN2
